      "items": [
        "Structural or interface: architect. Behavior or acceptance: spec. Experience or identity: product-designer. Scope analysis: pm",
        "A discrepancy requires diagnosis, not an assumption that the contract is wrong; technical uncertainty is resolved within authority",
        "Conflicting deltas from two in-flight tasks: freeze both, keep both staged, and escalate to the owner of the contract they share"
