      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Limits and decisions",
      "items": [
        "The user decides value, required authorization, irreversible effects, or no justifiable continuation; exhausted scope needs a user-approved finite allowance",
        "A second failing verdict for the same author key counts as one failed recovery; consecutive failed recoveries of one objective reach the limit",
        "After two nonconverging contract deltas, reassess the decomposition instead of issuing a third"
